OL,3,GNEWSAReintroduction of forest
OL,4,Abutterflies set to expand
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservationists who have helped
OL,7,Freintroduce a butterfly back into
OL,8,FEngland have been awarded #150,000 to
OL,9,Fexpand the project over the next three
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FIn total, 46 Chequered Skippers were
OL,13,Freleased into Rockingham Forest close
OL,14,Fto Corby, Northamptonshire, in May,
OL,15,Fusing a donor population from Belgium.
OL,17,FThe funding has been given to the
OL,18,FButterfly Conservation charity from
OL,19,FNatural England's Species Recovery
OL,20,FProgramme with the hope the species
OL,21,Fwill be reintroduced to Peterborough.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
